234	  }
235	
236	  // Execution bound (task-code-work DESIGN §2, §6) — an agentic task MUST
237	  // declare a positive-integer agent_execution_timeout. There is always a bound
238	  // on an agentic run; enforcement is best-effort (the executor surfaces the
